by bodendorfer-simplethings at 2026-05-05T04:38:08Z

> Is this legit? Isn't this hiding a bug earlier in the app? `$_ENV` should not contain array values (or any other non-scalars actually)

I agree with you, that a non scalar inside the `$_ENV` should not be considered as intended use.
However the use can simply set some values inside the `$_ENV` var.

If that is the case, the process component throws an exception. The MR changes that to silently ignore non-scalar values from `$_ENV`.

