> Is this legit? Isn't this hiding a bug earlier in the app? $_ENV should not contain array values (or any other non-scalars actually)

Hi, @nicolas-grekas, Process already skips false, argc/argv, and invalid names before proc_open() - this just extends the same defensive filtering to non-scalars, which proc_open() cannot handle regardless of their origin.
